cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Adaptive Filters for Image Denoising"
abstract: >-
  The LMS adaptive noise canceller in its six classic configurations (adaptive notch,
  bias canceller, canceller without a reference, self-tuning filter, adaptive line
  enhancer and reference-sensor canceller), carried from one-dimensional signals to
  images. Python and MATLAB implementations, a benchmark over eleven corruption models,
  application examples, and fixed-point Verilog cores with testbenches.
authors:
