license: MIT
date-released: "2026-11-24"
keywords:
  - adaptive filtering
  - LMS
  - adaptive noise cancellation
  - image denoising
  - adaptive notch filter
  - adaptive line enhancer
  - blind-spot prediction
  - fixed-point Verilog
